{"format":1,"key":"zone:darnassus","path":"/lore/zone/darnassus","name":"Darnassus","kind":"zone","label":"Capital","zone":{"key":"darnassus","name":"Darnassus","path":"/lore/zone/darnassus"},"levels":"","description":"Darnassus is the serene, open-air capital city of the night elves, built amidst the branches of the newly planted World Tree, Teldrassil. Governed by…","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"zone:darnassus","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["Darnassus is the serene, open-air capital city of the night elves, built amidst the branches of the newly planted World Tree, Teldrassil. Governed by High Priestess Tyrande Whisperwind alongside the druids of the Cenarion Enclave, it serves as a tranquil sanctuary for an ancient people adapting to mortality. Sheltered across vast terraces surrounding a crystalline lake, it stands as the heart of night elf society and their bridge to the Alliance.","Unlike the dense masonry of Stormwind or the carved stone tunnels of Ironforge, Darnassus is broad, quiet, and intimately open to the wilderness. Formed upon the upper canopy of Teldrassil off northern Kalimdor's coast, the capital's graceful wooden structures and winding pathways encircle a tranquil central lake. Elegant bridges connect terraces dedicated to tradesmen, craftsmen, sentinels, and druids, creating an atmosphere that balances civic governance with profound reverence for nature."],"hash":"64ec56","voices":{"male-narrator":{"sha":"c8b1faf7b5","sec":43},"female-narrator":{"sha":"8c06deba84","sec":58}}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Darnassus","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Darnassus"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/subzone/temple-of-the-moon","n":"Temple of the Moon","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/cenarion-enclave","n":"Cenarion Enclave","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/rut-theran-village","n":"Rut'theran Village","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/npc/tyrande-whisperwind","n":"Tyrande Whisperwind","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/fandral-stag